// Secrets this project needs. `devkey need` reports what is missing and the
// exact command to fix it. Values live in the machine's system keyring.
//
//   devkey need                  what is missing right now
//   devkey approve cloudflare    grant the token to this shell (needs a TTY)
//
// cloudflare provisions the reader.sbdev.io tunnel and its DNS record, and is
// used ONLY from a workstation. beagle-ab holds the per-tunnel credential JSON
// instead, which authorizes running that one tunnel and nothing else. See the
// dev-fleet beagle-ab-hosting skill.
//
// OPENROUTER_API_KEY is deliberately absent: the server reads it at runtime
// from ~/.config/reader/env on the host, not from a deploy-time environment.
needs "cloudflare"
